<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right">Emerging growth company&#160;&#160;<span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_900_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20230503__20230503_zzgLSK1TMec3"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-05-03to2023-05-03" format="ixt:booleanfalse" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#168;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

