<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="text-decoration: underline">Proposal 2 - Ratification of Appointment of
Independent Registered Public Accounting Firm</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Gran Tierra&#8217;s stockholders ratified the
selection of KPMG LLP as Gran Tierra&#8217;s independent registered public accounting firm for the fiscal year ending December 31, 2023.
The tabulation of votes on this matter was as follows:</p>

